      "description": "<p>Roll to randomly determine the right or left eye. The frigid air has frozen over the surface layer of your eye. The eye is <strong>nonfunctional</strong>. If not treated within 12 hours, your vision will be permanently <strong>missing</strong>.</p><p><em>Treatment</em> - A DC 20 Save Sense Surgery. If the player spends a short rest rewarming the area within 15 minutes of the injury occurring, this DC is decreased to 10.</p>",
